  unitName: Armored Knight (EU)
  unitId: 740164
  unitNumber: 7118
  description: One of the members of the order of the round table, the Armored Knight
    is definitely the most mysterious one. Undefeated in battle, he has served Arthur
    well. Nobody really knows where his armor or lance came from, but they seem to
    be made out of a powerful metallic alloy created using some sort of plasma fusion.
    However, once in combat, it looks like this knight is powered by magic as he
    relentlessly lunges at his adversaries. Though the Armored Knight attracts many
    women with his boastfulness, the other knights strongly dislike his pompous attitude.
  summonDesc: "I am the undefeated Knight! You are no match for me! Isn\u2019t that
    right, ladies?"
  fusionDesc: "Hah, trying to make me stronger, Summoner? Don\u2019t make me laugh."
